# No Edits to sfcc/meta_sandbox/

The `sfcc/meta_sandbox/` directory is **auto-generated by a GitHub Actions pipeline**. Developers never commit changes to it directly.

## Rule

**NEVER** create, modify, or delete any file under `sfcc/meta_sandbox/`.

When SFCC metadata changes are needed, edit **only** `sfcc/meta_delta/` (the incremental delta directory that developers commit to). The pipeline merges deltas into `meta_sandbox` automatically.

## Anti-patterns

- Adding custom attributes to `sfcc/meta_sandbox/site_template/meta/system-objecttype-extensions.xml` — WRONG
- Creating new XML files under `sfcc/meta_sandbox/` — WRONG
- "Keeping meta_sandbox in sync with meta_delta" manually — WRONG, the pipeline does this
